   "subject": "Suggestions for improving species richness and activity plots",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div>I used the existing code from the Vignettes to plot the species richness plots and activity patterns. I wanted to improve the plots (legends, axis labels etc..,) but could not. Which other packages can be used to improve the plots together with camtrapR?</div><div><br></div><div>My code and the resulting plot </div><div><br></div><div>activityOverlap (recordTable = sppRT_mod,<br>                 recordDateTimeFormat = &quot;%d/%m/%Y %H:%M&quot;,<br>                 speciesA    = speciesA_for_activity,<br>                 speciesB    = speciesB_for_activity,<br>                 writePNG    = FALSE,<br>                 plotR       = TRUE,<br>                 pngMaxPix   = 1000,<br>                 linecol     = c(&quot;black&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;),<br>                 linewidth   = c(5,3),<br>                 linetype    = c(1, 2),<br>                 olapcol     = &quot;darkgrey&quot;,<br>                 add.rug     = TRUE,<br>                 extend      = &quot;lightgrey&quot;,<br>                 ylim        = c(0, 0.25),<br>                 main        = paste(&quot;Activity overlap: &quot;, speciesA_for_activity, &quot;-&quot;, speciesB_for_activity)<br>)<br></div><div><br></div><div><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/camtrapr/attach/192cfd5ef0b2a/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"487\" height=\"274\"><br></div><div><br></div><div>I need to make the legend box small.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div><br></div><div>best,</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><font><font><font><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Letro (Mr.)</font></font></b></font></font></font></div><div><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\">Nature Conservation Division</b></font></font></font></div><div><b style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Department of Forests and Park Services</font></font></b></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(56,118,29)\"><font><font>Ministry of Agriculture and Forests</font></font></span><br></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Taba, Thimphu, Bhutan</font></font></font></font></span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Phone: +975 02 325042 (O) Mobile: <a href=\"tel:+975%2017%2038%2059%2022\" value=\"+97517385922\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+97517385922</a></font></font></font></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,0)\"><font><font><font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">web: </font></font></font></font></span><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460148001000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oirvdn_QZetvOFnlwxzyD\">https://leythro-darlo.blogspot.com/</a></font></div><div><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><br><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
