    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p>Dear Letro, </p>\r\n    <p>there are a few options: <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>use the Export tab in RStudio, Save as Image, then experiment\r\n        with the image size<br>\r\n      </li>\r\n      <li>store the output of activityOverlap in an object. Output is a\r\n        data frame with time axis and density of both species. <br>\r\n      </li>\r\n      <li>with a little bit of effort you can plot the data frame in\r\n        ggplot2 also (I don&#39;t have any readymade code for it though). <br>\r\n      </li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <p>Best regards,</p>\r\n    <p>Jürgen<br>\r\n    </p></div>"
    ],
