     3,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,\r\n        <div>I used the existing code from the Vignettes to plot the\r\n          species richness plots and activity patterns. I wanted to\r\n          improve the plots (legends, axis labels etc..,) but could not.\r\n          Which other packages can be used to improve the plots together\r\n          with camtrapR?</div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>My code and the resulting plot </div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>activityOverlap (recordTable = sppRT_mod,<br>\r\n                           recordDateTimeFormat = &quot;%d/%m/%Y %H:%M&quot;,<br>\r\n                           speciesA    = speciesA_for_activity,<br>\r\n                           speciesB    = speciesB_for_activity,<br>\r\n                           writePNG    = FALSE,<br>\r\n                           plotR       = TRUE,<br>\r\n                           pngMaxPix   = 1000,<br>\r\n                           linecol     = c(&quot;black&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;),<br>\r\n                           linewidth   = c(5,3),<br>\r\n                           linetype    = c(1, 2),<br>\r\n                           olapcol     = &quot;darkgrey&quot;,<br>\r\n                           add.rug     = TRUE,<br>\r\n                           extend      = &quot;lightgrey&quot;,<br>\r\n                           ylim        = c(0, 0.25),<br>\r\n                           main        = paste(&quot;Activity overlap: &quot;,\r\n          speciesA_for_activity, &quot;-&quot;, speciesB_for_activity)<br>\r\n          )<br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/camtrapr/attach/1d51390d8617c/image.png?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"487\" height=\"274\"><br>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div><br>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div>I need to make the legend box small.